  <name>notm</name>
  <summary>Read and manage mail in a Notmuch database</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      notm is a native GTK desktop mail client for existing Notmuch mail
      stores. It provides a column-based, keyboard-friendly interface for
      searching, reading, composing, and tagging mail while leaving storage
      and synchronization under the user's control.
    </p>
